            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Saigon - Tan Son Nhat Airport",
            "review_text": "My P\n1 contribution\n0\nOne of my favorite Vietnamese restaurants\nSep 2025 • Family\nLast weekend, I visited a local Vietnamese restaurant, and it was a great experience. The food was fresh and full of flavor, especially the pho and spring rolls. The staff were friendly and helpful, and the service was quick. I really appreciated the cozy atmosphere and clean space. Prices were reasonable for the quality of the food. One small downside was that it got a bit noisy during peak hours, but overall, I enjoyed it a lot. I would definitely recommend this place to anyone looking for authentic Vietnamese food. I’m planning to go back again soon!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 29, 2025",
